@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-75 - Close Conversation

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Chat Widget / Admin Chat UI" as FE
control "ChatController" as API
control "ChatService" as Service
database "MongoDB: chatConversations" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-75
FE -> API: PATCH /chat/conversations/:id/status
API -> Service: Execute Close Conversation
Service -> DB: Read/write chatConversations
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Conversation status = CLOSED

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Conversation đang mở
Post: Conversation status = CLOSED
Main flow:
1. Admin bấm Close Chat
2. System gọi API PATCH /chat/conversations/:id/status
3. System set status = CLOSED
4. Conversation không còn xuất hiện trong danh sách mở
end note
@enduml
